# Stilwell Farms crops 2: new ripe crops, fruit trees, giant pumpkin (COMMON).
# Same conventions as RIPE_* in 10_terrain.art: colour 0 = dry soil; leaves = 58b040; light top-left.
# SOIL-pal quadrants (cauliflower curd) use colour 1 = the same b07840 dry soil.
# Trees: lit GRASS crown on top, fruit in the shaded underside band (RED/ORANGE), like FRUIT_TREE_RIPE.
# PEACH_TREE_RIPE top half = FRUIT_TREE top verbatim (shares tiles). Blueberries: no blue in the crop
# palettes, so they are dark rimmed berries with a 6c4428 body.
# GIANT_PUMPKIN: the quadrant x8-15,y0-7 is RED for the prize rosette tied to the stem.

